```{=html}
<div class="grid">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<div class="g-col-12 g-col-sm-6 g-col-lg-4">
<div class="card h-100">
<video class="card-img-top" muted loop autoplay playsinline preload="metadata">
  <source src="<%= item.video %>" type="video/mp4">
</video>
<div class="card-body">
<h5 class="card-title no-anchor"><a href="<%- item.path %>"><%= item.title %></a></h5>
<p class="card-text"><%= item.description %></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
